# Assets and Generated
*.exe
*.log
scripts/backups/

# ── WhatsApp Session Auth (CRITICAL - never delete, never track) ───────
# Baileys stores session keys here. These files are modified at runtime
# by the running bot, so tracking them in git causes `git pull` to fail
# on every deploy ("Your local changes would be overwritten by merge").
# This is what broke every deploy since commit 72d980a1 - the bot was
# stuck running old code while every "successful" GitHub Action was
# actually a no-op deploy.
instances/*/auth/
instances/*/auth/**

# Runtime-generated per-instance data (safe to exclude from git)
instances/*/database/
instances/*/downloads/
scripts/.monitor_marker
scripts/monitor_loop.sh

# Secrets - never commit env files or their backups.
# Added after scratch scripts with a hardcoded MONGO_URI were found
# staged for a push to a PUBLIC repo.
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env.backup

# ── Cleanup 2026-09-15: local backup artifacts & scratch ─────────────
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak_*
*.pre_*_bak*
*.backup
*.backup-*
backups/
.perf-patch-backup/

# sandbox/local quiz caches (2026-10-01)
core/data/quiz_pools/
core/data/quiz_recent_used.json
.gemini/
scripts/_memmongo.pid

# Baileys runtime auth (2026-10-03): never tracked in git again.
# Deploys resolve auth via deploy_on_box.sh precedence (disk wins over git).
instances/*/auth/

# fx lab runtime state (2026-10-16): mutates in production, would phantom-diff forever
fx_captures/fx.log
fx_captures/poll_votes.json
fx_captures/poll_registry.json
fx_captures/tap_state.json
fx_captures/.catch_on

# quiz runtime caches (2026-10-16): generated at runtime, phantom-diff noise (942 untracked on box1)
data/quiz_cache/
core/data/quiz_audio_cache/

# preleaf-conflict backup artifacts (2026-10-16): deliberate .before-style backups, never tracked
*.preleafconflict-*

# baked render media disk cache (2026-10-16): runtime-generated mp4/png per stateHash, survives deploys as untracked, never tracked
media_cache/

# 47-k8: Lords Mobile marker renders — derived from game assets, box-provisioned only, never committed
core/rpgasset/kingdom3d/lm_castle_*

# generated artefacts (untracked 2026-10-28 cleanup)
scripts/render_out/
